{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>看到呢個「嘔吐貓咪」，有沒有想起一個搞笑memes圖呢！第一眼見到它，真的會以為要吐出抹茶！原本設計師特別將茶碗打造出貓咪頭部形狀，只要將抹茶倒下去，抹茶就會順住嘴吧慢慢流出，場景離奇又極具喜感，簡直是將memes實體化！網民一見到這個產品，都覺得很有趣：「這個造型真的在可愛和荒謬之間抓得剛剛好」、「忍不住多看幾眼」、「我需要一個！」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178689668663062513_19814027396a81e12ee207c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17868966881027063_16071085846a81e1308e809.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178689669001030913_17181053756a81e132968cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178689669215932625_13335636346a81e134696a1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T16:19:20.390620+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}